 "notes": [
  "MeSH terms and author keywords were re-fetched from PubMed for the analytic records (Multimedia Appendix 1, Note 10). (b) Lexicon: pre-specified term lists matched to MeSH, keywords, title and abstract (verbatim in Note 10); LLM: concern-theme classifier. Both measured among critical records; trends are Spearman ρ (exact P) over 5 annual values and OR per year. (c-d) Weighted log-odds ratio with an informative Dirichlet prior (Monroe et al. 2008; prior from all retained records, α0=1000; terms in at least 20 records); z is the log-odds difference divided by its SE; records = documents containing the term in each group. Plotted in {{F:lexicon_vs_llm_fig}} and {{F:terms_fig}}. Critical stance was Alarm or Caution."
 ],
